WEBVTT

00:32:54.746 --> 00:33:01.746
the most worrying of those risks? And
how is open eye working to minimize?

00:33:02.329 --> 00:33:05.579
I still think all of the really
horrifying risks exist.

00:33:05.621 --> 00:33:09.663
I am more confident, much
more confident than

00:33:09.663 --> 00:33:15.954
I was five years ago when we started that
there are technical things we can do

00:33:16.663 --> 00:33:20.579
about. How we build these systems
and the research and

00:33:20.579 --> 00:33:23.913
the alignment that make us much
more likely to end up in

00:33:23.913 --> 00:33:27.579
the kind of really wonderful camp, but,
you know,

00:33:27.579 --> 00:33:30.246
like maybe open I fall behind